          "start": 170
        },
        "quote": "(1) If a sign fails to meet the requirements of this chapter, the Planning and Development Director shall cause a notice to be sent to the owner of record of the tract or building upon which the sign is situated, and for billboards, to the permit holder of the sign, by certified mail, return receipt requested, and regular mail.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "80377e9b-6b25-53c5-a9d9-2387ed7a6bf9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 615,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:3",
          "start": 500
        },
        "quote": "(2) The notice shall inform the owner or permit holder of the location of the sign and the nature of the violation.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "daf74263-72b1-5125-b23e-0fe2c40caeb2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 799,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:4",
          "start": 616
        },
        "quote": "(3) The owner or permit holder shall have 30 days from the date on the notice to correct the violation. For good cause shown, the Building Official may extend the time for compliance.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "2f4c3185-020c-52e5-a99f-0e2b64baf10f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1111,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:5",
          "start": 800
        },
        "quote": "(4) Any owner or permit holder failing to timely correct the violation may be subject to criminal prosecution with the penalty as set forth in TMC 1.10.070 . The Planning and Development Director shall not issue building permits for new signs to any person who is in violation of the provisions of this chapter.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
