        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "91ef228a-bcb0-57ee-b530-e45fd4eab284",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2157,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:19",
          "start": 2085
        },
        "quote": "(xii) In a manner which obstructs any authorized traffic control device.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "12a7b0a0-2336-55c2-b8c7-cb33f16c314a",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2335,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:20",
          "start": 2158
        },
        "quote": "(2) Any signs removed under this subsection will be held for 10 days and, if not claimed within that time, will be disposed of in accordance with subsection (d) of this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "f2632984-9ebe-5dca-a85f-baa828663a87",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2546,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:21",
          "start": 2336
        },
        "quote": "(3) This subsection does not apply to signs erected by, on behalf of, or pursuant to the authorization of a governmental body, including identification, informational, traffic, directional, or regulatory signs.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "a27d35b2-2214-5bd7-9d5a-36a345d01cdd",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2582,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:22",
          "start": 2547
        },
        "quote": "(d) Fines and Cost of Sign Removal.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 23",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 23,
          "component_id": "56cac1fd-03b8-521d-b722-fbc9aeb60946",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2849,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:23",
          "start": 2583
        },
        "quote": "(1) In addition to any criminal penalties, each violation of this chapter shall be subject to an administrative monetary penalty in the amount of $50.00 levied by the Planning and Development Director. Every day of violation shall be a separate and distinct offense.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:23#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 24",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 24,
          "component_id": "fce8628a-c4a2-5e60-a347-1af0e1e2f984",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3182,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:24",
          "start": 2850
        },
        "quote": "(2) The fine may be collected from the property owner, sign owner, or permittee. If the property owner or permittee fails to pay the fine, such fine may be certified to the City Clerk, who shall assess the costs as a special assessment against the lot or parcel of land upon which the sign was located in the manner provided by law.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:24#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 25",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 25,
          "component_id": "677bccd2-a3d7-575d-a8a7-09f9c984a4a1",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3443,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:25",
          "start": 3183
        },
        "quote": "(3) Any sign removed by the Planning and Development Director may be disposed of in any reasonable manner. The Planning and Development Director, with the approval of the City Manager, may establish a fee schedule for removal and storage of unauthorized signs.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:25#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 26",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 26,
          "component_id": "4151148b-ad5a-548a-a4f9-c7bde26413a4",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3802,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:26",
          "start": 3444
        },
        "quote": "(4) The fee may be collected from the property owner, sign owner, or sign permittee. If the property owner, sign owner, or permittee fails to pay the authorized fee, such fee may be certified to the City Clerk, who shall assess the costs as a special assessment against the lot or parcel of land upon which the sign was located in the manner provided by law.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:26#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 27",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 27,
          "component_id": "61747292-6393-5c1d-8502-b9e3c80124c9",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3998,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:27",
          "start": 3803
        },
        "quote": "(e) Revocation of Permits. The Planning and Development Director may revoke any sign permit under the provisions of this chapter or order the removal of any sign for any of the following reasons:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:27#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 28",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 28,
          "component_id": "81aa725f-8b31-5606-a73b-c5cb074e98e7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 4138,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:28",
          "start": 3999
        },
        "quote": "(1) Whenever a permit holder is convicted of a violation of any of the provisions of this chapter or any other ordinance relating to signs;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.10.060:block:28#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.10.060 block 29",
